this was created originally during a great lsd trip ; now its a duty.
the idea here is rather simple : open source hassidism. 
Hassidism as the mystical approach in modern european judaism, a direct connection to god. 
No mediators between you and the creator, or your creator, or just god as a general idea.
the attempt here is to translate the jewish shamanism tradition to anybody who would like to experience such a connection, without nessescirily prescribing to the cosmological aspects of kabblah.
a personal, connection to god. not a religion, but a practice.
